PREFIX c: <https://geo-campaign-2026.example/ontology#>
PREFIX id: <https://geo-campaign-2026.example/id/>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>

# Q6 どのアプリをどのコンペ（部門）に出せるか。◎○△×？とスコア。
SELECT ?app ?appLabel ?target ?targetLabel ?mark ?score ?reason
WHERE {
  ?f a c:Fit ; c:fitApp ?app ; c:fitTarget ?target ; c:mark ?mark ; c:score ?score ; c:reason ?reason .
  ?app rdfs:label ?appLabel . ?target rdfs:label ?targetLabel .
}
ORDER BY ?app DESC(?score) ?target
